 "summary": "No. On BTC, ETH and SOL, RSI(7) crossing MFI(14) up or down did no better than random candles on 1h, 4h or daily, with or without the 40 and 60 zone filters. Only two results leave the luck band: RSI(7) above MFI(14) on 1h, and the daily short on a cross down above 60, and each disappears once one stretch of entries is left out.",
 "verdicts": [
  {
